---
import RangeBand from './RangeBand.astro';
---

<section id="ranges">
  <div class="wrap ranges-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">The philosophy</span>
      <h2>You don't need one number. You need room.</h2>
      <p class="lede"
        >Calculators hand you a single rigid target and call it a plan. Then
        Tuesday happens. Callie builds you a band instead: calories, protein,
        carbs, and fat as ranges. Busy, active day? Eat the top. Slow day, sick
        kid, no sleep? The bottom. <strong style="color:var(--ink)"
          >Both count as a win.</strong
        ></p
      >
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px"
        >Your ranges flex with nursing, activity, stress, and how fast you're
        actually losing. This is what a plan looks like when it's built for a
        mother, not a spreadsheet.</p
      >
    </div>
    <div
      class="ui-card rv"
      aria-label="Example of hand-built macro ranges from the app"
    >
      <div class="greet">Hi Sarah.</div>
      <div class="greet-sub"
        >Live inside the bands. Busy, active day? Eat the top. Slow day? The
        bottom. Both count as a win.</div
      >
      <div class="range-row">
        <div class="range-head"
          ><span class="label">Protein</span><span class="val"
            >115–125 <small>g</small></span
          ></div
        >
        <RangeBand />
        <div class="band-labels"
          ><span>slower day → aim low</span><span>active day → aim high</span></div
        >
      </div>
      <div class="range-row">
        <div class="range-head"
          ><span class="label">Carbs</span><span class="val"
            >160–175 <small>g</small></span
          ></div
        >
        <RangeBand />
        <div class="band-labels"
          ><span>slower day → aim low</span><span>active day → aim high</span></div
        >
      </div>
      <div class="range-row">
        <div class="range-head"
          ><span class="label">Fat</span><span class="val"
            >55–65 <small>g</small></span
          ></div
        >
        <RangeBand />
        <div class="band-labels"
          ><span>slower day → aim low</span><span>active day → aim high</span></div
        >
      </div>
      <div class="cal-line"
        ><span class="label">Calories land around</span><span class="val"
          >1,850–2,000</span
        ></div
      >
      <div class="human-note"
        ><span class="dot"></span>Built by Callie from your intake. Nursing?
        Your ranges already account for it.</div
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
